2. Regional internet registry delegated statistics (geoip/<cc>.txt, including geoip/cn.txt)
   APNIC   https://ftp.apnic.net/stats/apnic/delegated-apnic-latest
   ARIN    https://ftp.arin.net/pub/stats/arin/delegated-arin-extended-latest
   RIPE NCC https://ftp.ripe.net/pub/stats/ripencc/delegated-ripencc-extended-latest
   LACNIC  https://ftp.lacnic.net/pub/stats/lacnic/delegated-lacnic-extended-latest
   AFRINIC https://ftp.afrinic.net/pub/stats/afrinic/delegated-afrinic-extended-latest
   The IPv4 and IPv6 ranges of each country or region code are computed from the records
   with status allocated or assigned of all five files and merged by code (records
   without a country, and available or reserved space, are ignored). Each registry
   publishes these statistics openly for download; they are used under the conditions of
   use each registry states on its website (for APNIC: https://www.apnic.net/about-apnic/legal/),
   and no registry gives a warranty. The files are registries of address delegations,
   not maps of physical locations, so the result can differ from commercial GeoIP
   databases (an address block registered by a company in one country may be used in
   another).

3. Telegram (geoip/telegram.txt)
   https://core.telegram.org/resources/cidr.txt
   The address ranges Telegram publishes for its own servers, used unchanged apart from
   sorting and merging adjacent ranges.

4. Google (geoip/google.txt)
   https://www.gstatic.com/ipranges/goog.json minus https://www.gstatic.com/ipranges/cloud.json
   Google documents this subtraction as the way to get the addresses of Google services
   (as opposed to Google Cloud customers). The files are published by Google for this
   purpose (https://support.google.com/a/answer/10026322).

5. Special-purpose addresses (geoip/private.txt)
   A fixed list written for this project from the IANA IPv4 and IPv6 Special-Purpose
   Address Registries (RFC 6890): 0.0.0.0/8, 10.0.0.0/8, 100.64.0.0/10, 127.0.0.0/8,
   169.254.0.0/16, 172.16.0.0/12, 192.0.0.0/24, 192.0.2.0/24, 192.88.99.0/24,
   192.168.0.0/16, 198.18.0.0/15, 198.51.100.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24, 224.0.0.0/3,
   ::/127, fc00::/7, fe80::/10, ff00::/8.

